  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4ea107d3d0fbef947af73792cc9f28a0, type: 3}
  m_Name: HubertEnding
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  dialogueType: 0
  sentences:
  - On today's Breaking News!
  - There has been reports of a massive explosion occurring at Cubert Daycare.
  - Nobody knows how this explosion happened, or who did it as there were no survivors.
  - Actually, I'm hearing now that there was one survivor in the explosion...
  - A cubert named Vubert was supposedly the only survivor in the incident.
  - Also, a citizen named Calvin says that there are chunks of his cubert, Hubert,
    all over the city.
  - He is now suing Cubert Daycare for the death of Hubert. This has started a trend
    of lawsuits against Cubert Daycare.
  - Some of the citizens who are suing the daycare never even owned a cubert... If
    you are one of these citizens, please stop suing them.
  - That's all for today's Breaking News! Thanks for watching.
